    "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 170, Number 40 (Wednesday, March 6, 2024)]\n[House]\n[Pages H999-H1000]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Ms. OCASIO-CORTEZ:\nH.R. 7569.\n[[Page H1000]]\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle 1, Section 8\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nTo improve rights to relief for individuals affected by\nnon-consensual activities involving intimate digital\nforgeries, and for other purposes.\n</pre>",
